flowchart LR
  O[Orchestrator verifies pinned sources and global caps]
  subgraph DataStage[Card Data stage]
    D[Card Data Low] --> DF{FORMAT check}
    DF -->|retry remaining| D
  end
  subgraph AuditStage[Rule Audit stage]
    A[Rule Audit High] --> AF{FORMAT check}
    AF -->|retry remaining| A
  end
  subgraph PrintStage[Print Match stage]
    P[Print Match High first blind read retained] --> PF{FORMAT check}
    PF -->|retry remaining and no replacement| P
  end
  O -->|pinned source packet| D
  O -->|pinned source packet| A
  DF -->|accepted producer rows| A
  O -->|only pinned images IDs and names| P
  DF -->|accepted data| V[Final source rule and print validation]
  AF -->|accepted audit| V
  PF -->|accepted first blind evidence| V
  DF -->|exhausted| S[Stop with preserved diagnostics]
  AF -->|exhausted| S
  PF -->|exhausted| S
  V -->|source or rule failure| S
  V -->|synthetic or unresolved print| Q[QA diagnostics only no CSV]
  V -->|eligible validated real rows| C[DT_Cards.csv and QA report]
  C --> H1[My review, Gate 1]
  H1 --> H2[Independent check, Gate 2]
  H2 --> H3[My sign-off, Gate 3]
